   "use": "Said about keeping up with the news, often in the past as a conversation opener: nyuusu mita? (did you see the news?). Something you learned from it is nyuusu de mita (I saw it on the news) or nyuusu de yatteta (it was on the news). It covers news apps on a phone too. Casual speech drops o.",
